{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE WASTELAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ether mining ravaged the planet, poisoning skies with toxic storms and forcing survivors into underground ruins. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emerge as a SCAV to brave mutated horrors and fulfill desperate contracts from below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/03337418fae63517437a2f5a72d3cb5c.poster.avif?t=1762203991\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/03337418fae63517437a2f5a72d3cb5c.webm?t=1762203991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/03337418fae63517437a2f5a72d3cb5c.mp4?t=1762203991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive through ethereal, fog-shrouded dunes in your truck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate colossal ancient ruins and wrecks, mastering precise platforming amid a dreamlike liminal wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/fadd8ccef0e49e559211c482041b3151.poster.avif?t=1762203991\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/fadd8ccef0e49e559211c482041b3151.webm?t=1762203991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/fadd8ccef0e49e559211c482041b3151.mp4?t=1762203991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SCAVENGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your winch to carve paths and unearth hidden relics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your tetris skills to pack your truck's inventory full of parts to upgrade your truck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/c9babb87121f597a27ac68fe0aa0ffa6.poster.avif?t=1762203991\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/c9babb87121f597a27ac68fe0aa0ffa6.webm?t=1762203991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/c9babb87121f597a27ac68fe0aa0ffa6.mp4?t=1762203991\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle ravenous mutants in high-octane chases with drifting and shooting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your approach carefully against hostile sands, miasma, and ether tempests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/c936269aeb3b3039adc2ee9f73cee0f8.poster.avif?t=1762203991\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/extras/c936269aeb3b3039adc2ee9f73cee0f8.webm?t=1762203991\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1162660?t=1762203991","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1162660?t=1762203991","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1162660/8cd9a34fda595b9afa339519580dc21f44358e16/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762203991","capsu